The UI behavior now matches the acceptance criteria:
- “Setting up checks...” only shows with a spinner when merge readiness is still loading and `checks_total === 0`.
- If all checks are passing, the spinner is suppressed even when `mergeable_state === 'unknown'`.
- In that `unknown + checks passing` case, the page shows `Waiting for GitHub to confirm mergeability...` as subtle non-spinner text.

